# Kraum, Violent Cacophony: ruling 2024-04-12: if Kraum was the first spell cast this turn, the next spell is the second
# (CR 207.2c). On turn 3 Bot1 casts Kraum first from untapped Moxen, then a Memnite: the Memnite is the second spell and
# Kraum, already on the battlefield, grows and Bot1 draws (hand: Island, the card drawn for the turn, and the one drawn here).
[Bot1 Deck]
Kraum, Violent Cacophony
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Memnite
Island
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

